   sa nehýbe. --lcd1v-cookies-vyska = horný okraj karty od spodku okna (cookies.js). :not(#lcd1v-x) = váha ID, inak by
   vyhralo body:has(#js-plugin-header.active) … {bottom:72px !important} (LCD-HDR) a lišta 1V (LCD-1V-CENA). */
html:root.lcd1v-cookies-bublina:not(#lcd1v-x):has(.js-siteCookies .siteCookies__form) iframe[title="Luxia chat"] {
